{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "A Secure Enclave key cannot be restored or moved. Generate a new one and add its public key to the server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 密钥无法恢复或迁移。请重新生成一把，并把它的公钥添加到服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 金鑰無法復原或遷移。請重新產生一把，並把它的公開金鑰加入伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A certificate looks like a public key but its type ends in `-cert-v01@openssh.com`. It is the file `ssh-keygen -s` writes, usually named `…-cert.pub`.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "证书看起来像公钥，但类型以 `-cert-v01@openssh.com` 结尾。它是 `ssh-keygen -s` 写出的文件，通常叫 `…-cert.pub`。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "憑證看起來像公鑰，但類型以 `-cert-v01@openssh.com` 結尾。它是 `ssh-keygen -s` 寫出的檔案，通常叫 `…-cert.pub`。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ApexTerminal does not support %@ keys yet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ApexTerminal 尚不支持 %@ 密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ApexTerminal 尚不支援 %@ 金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check that the port really is an SSH server, and that the server's log does not show a rejected connection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查该端口上运行的确实是 SSH 服务器，并确认服务器日志中没有被拒绝的连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查該連接埠上執行的確實是 SSH 伺服器，並確認伺服器日誌中沒有被拒絕的連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check that the server is reachable and really is an SSH server, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请确认该服务器可以连接，并且确实是 SSH 服务器，然后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請確認該伺服器可以連線，並且確實是 SSH 伺服器，然後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the hostname, the port, and that the server is reachable from this network.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请核对主机名和端口，并确认从此网络可以访问该服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請核對主機名稱與連接埠，並確認從此網路可以連線到該伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the passphrase and try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请核对密码短语后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請核對密碼短語後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the server's sshd configuration, then try again.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查服务器的 sshd 配置，然后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查伺服器的 sshd 設定，然後重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check the username, and that the key is in the server's authorized_keys or that the password is correct.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请检查用户名，并确认密钥已在服务器的 authorized_keys 中，或密码正确。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請檢查使用者名稱，並確認金鑰已在伺服器的 authorized_keys 中，或密碼正確。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect again and answer the server's questions.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重新连接，并回答服务器的问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請重新連線，並回答伺服器的問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect again and complete the Face ID or Touch ID check.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重新连接，并完成 Face ID 或 Touch ID 验证。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請重新連線，並完成 Face ID 或 Touch ID 驗證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connection cancelled because the host key was not accepted.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由于 host key 未被接受，连接已取消。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "由於 host key 未被接受，連線已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not connect to %@ on port %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法通过端口 %2$@ 连接到 %1$@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法透過連接埠 %2$@ 連線到 %1$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not start the SSH session.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法启动 SSH 会话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法啟動 SSH 工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not continue unless you know the server was rebuilt or rekeyed. If you did not expect this, someone may be intercepting the connection.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请勿继续，除非你确知该服务器已被重建或更换了密钥。如果这并非你预期的情况，可能有人正在拦截此连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請勿繼續，除非你確知該伺服器已被重建或更換了金鑰。如果這並非你預期的情況，可能有人正在攔截此連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Enter the key's passphrase to import it.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请输入该密钥的密码短语以导入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請輸入該金鑰的密碼短語以匯入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export the key with `ssh-keygen -p -f <key>` or generate a new one in ApexTerminal.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 `ssh-keygen -p -f <key>` 导出该密钥，或在 ApexTerminal 中生成一个新密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 `ssh-keygen -p -f <key>` 匯出該金鑰，或在 ApexTerminal 中產生一個新金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Face ID and Touch ID are not set up on this device.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本设备尚未设置 Face ID 或 Touch ID。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本裝置尚未設定 Face ID 或 Touch ID。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Face ID or Touch ID could not confirm it was you.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Face ID 或 Touch ID 未能确认是你本人。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Face ID 或 Touch ID 未能確認是你本人。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For environments whose policy requires a NIST curve.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "适用于策略要求使用 NIST 曲线的环境。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "適用於政策要求使用 NIST 曲線的環境。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Generate an ordinary key instead; it is stored in the Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请改为生成普通密钥，它会保存在钥匙串中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請改為產生一般金鑰，它會保存在鑰匙圈中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have expired, be issued for another host name, or be signed by an authority this device does not trust.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可能已过期、是为另一个主机名签发的，或者签发它的机构不在本设备的信任列表中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可能已過期、是為另一個主機名稱簽發的，或者簽發它的機構不在本裝置的信任清單中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No credential was accepted for an attempt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次尝试没有任何凭据被接受。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本次嘗試沒有任何憑據被接受。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Open the files again to reconnect.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请重新打开文件以重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請重新開啟檔案以重新連線。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Re-encrypt the key with `ssh-keygen -p -Z aes256-ctr -f <key>`, or import it without a passphrase.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 `ssh-keygen -p -Z aes256-ctr -f <key>` 重新加密该密钥，或在不设置密码短语的情况下导入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 `ssh-keygen -p -Z aes256-ctr -f <key>` 重新加密該金鑰，或在不設定密碼短語的情況下匯入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Re-encrypt the key with a current version of `ssh-keygen`.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请使用较新版本的 `ssh-keygen` 重新加密该密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請使用較新版本的 `ssh-keygen` 重新加密該金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recommended. Short, fast, and supported by every current server.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐。简短、快速，当前所有服务器都支持。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推薦。簡短、快速，目前所有伺服器都支援。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reconnect to continue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新连接以继续。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新連線以繼續。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set one up in Settings, or create the key so that it only needs the device to be unlocked.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在“设置”中设置一项，或者创建一把只要求设备解锁的密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請在「設定」中設定一項，或者建立一把只要求裝置解鎖的金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up Face ID, Touch ID or a passcode, or choose “While the device is unlocked”.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请设置 Face ID、Touch ID 或密码，或者选择“设备解锁时”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請設定 Face ID、Touch ID 或密碼，或者選擇「裝置解鎖時」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signing in was cancelled.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录已取消。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入已取消。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That file is not an OpenSSH private key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该文件不是 OpenSSH 私钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該檔案不是 OpenSSH 私密金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not a valid OpenSSH public key line.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是一行有效的 OpenSSH 公钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是一行有效的 OpenSSH 公開金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is not an OpenSSH certificate.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这不是一张 OpenSSH 证书。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這不是一張 OpenSSH 憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That passphrase does not unlock this key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该密码短语无法解锁此密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該密碼短語無法解鎖此金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SSH handshake did not complete in time.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 握手未在规定时间内完成。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 交握未在時限內完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SSH handshake failed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 握手失败。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SSH 交握失敗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The SSH session could not be established.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法建立 SSH 会话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法建立 SSH 工作階段。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Secure Enclave would not create the key.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 拒绝创建这把密钥。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Secure Enclave 拒絕建立這把金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The certificate could not be read.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法读取该证书。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法讀取該憑證。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file connection was closed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "文件连接已关闭。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "檔案連線已關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The generated key did not round-trip; it has not been saved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "生成的密钥未通过往返验证（无法重新解析），因此没有保存。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "產生的金鑰未通過往返驗證（無法重新解析），因此沒有儲存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The host key for %@ has changed.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的 host key 已变更。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 的 host key 已變更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last credential tried was a %@.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最后尝试的凭据是 %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最後嘗試的憑據是 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The port may already be in use, or the server may not allow remote forwarding — check that its sshd has AllowTcpForwarding and, for a port below 1024 or a non-local address, GatewayPorts.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该端口可能已被占用，或服务器不允许远程转发——请检查其 sshd 是否设置了 AllowTcpForwarding；若端口低于 1024 或地址不是本机，还需要 GatewayPorts。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該連接埠可能已被佔用，或伺服器不允許遠端轉發——請檢查其 sshd 是否設定了 AllowTcpForwarding；若連接埠低於 1024 或位址不是本機，還需要 GatewayPorts。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The private key file is damaged or incomplete.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该私钥文件已损坏或不完整。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "該私密金鑰檔案已損毀或不完整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server closed the connection before the SSH session was established.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器在 SSH 会话建立前关闭了连接。"
          }
